"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"24\">-ment becomes -mento</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"595\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"22\">wrong ending again</text><rect x=\"200\" y=\"680\" width=\"700\" height=\"150\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.15)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"735\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-size=\"28\" font-weight=\"bold\">THE ANSWER</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"790\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"30\">posibilidad</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"890\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"24\">Es una posibilidad.  =  It is a possibility.</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"960\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ec4899\" font-size=\"23\">Note: Spanish writes one s where English writes two.</text></svg>",
