     "type": "quiz",
     "question": "How would you say the everyday question **¿Qué hay?** — \"What is there?\" — out loud?",
     "options": [
      {
       "text": "kweh EYE — the u is heard, the h is not",
       "correct": false
      },
      {
       "text": "keh HIGH — the h is heard, the u is not",
       "correct": false
      },
      {
       "text": "**KEH** eye — neither the u nor the h is pronounced",
       "correct": true
      },
      {
       "text": "kweh HIGH — both the u and the h are pronounced",
       "correct": false
      }
     ],
     "explanation": "Two silent letters in three syllables. In **qué**, the u after q is a spelling device with no sound of its own, so the word is **KEH** — never KWEH. In **hay**, the h is silent as every Spanish h is, leaving ay, which sounds like the English word eye. So **¿Qué hay?** comes out as **KEH** eye. The same silent u appears in **queso** (**KEH**-soh) and **quince** (**KEEN**-seh), and the same silent h in **hola**, **hombre** and **ahora**.",
     "visual": {
      "type": "diagram",
      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\">\n<rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/>\n<text x=\"550\" y=\"55\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">WRITTEN BUT NEVER SPOKEN</text>\n<rect x=\"80\" y=\"110\" width=\"420\" height=\"330\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"rgba(239,68,68,0.15)\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"3\"/>\n<text x=\"290\" y=\"175\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"30\">THE SILENT H</text>\n<text x=\"290\" y=\"285\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"110\">h</text>\n<line x1=\"215\" y1=\"310\" x2=\"365\" y2=\"180\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"8\"/>\n<text x=\"290\" y=\"350\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"24\">hola, hombre, hasta</text>\n<text x=\"290\" y=\"395\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"22\">Start on the vowel instead.</text>\n<rect x=\"600\" y=\"110\" width=\"420\" height=\"330\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.15)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"3\"/>\n<text x=\"810\" y=\"175\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"30\">THE SILENT U</text>\n<text x=\"810\" y=\"285\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"110\">qu</text>\n<line x1=\"720\" y1=\"310\" x2=\"900\" y2=\"180\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"8\"/>\n<text x=\"810\" y=\"350\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"24\">queso, quince, aqui</text>\n<text x=\"810\" y=\"395\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"22\">Also gue and gui: guitarra.</text>\n<rect x=\"80\" y=\"480\" width=\"940\" height=\"440\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.15)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"3\"/>\n<text x=\"130\" y=\"540\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"28\">WRITTEN                        SAID</text>\n<line x1=\"130\" y1=\"560\" x2=\"970\" y2=\"560\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<text x=\"130\" y=\"620\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"28\">hola</text>\n<text x=\"470\" y=\"620\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"28\">--&gt;</text>\n<text x=\"620\" y=\"620\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"28\">OH-lah</text>\n<text x=\"130\" y=\"685\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"28\">hombre</text>\n<text x=\"470\" y=\"685\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"28\">--&gt;</text>\n<text x=\"620\" y=\"685\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"28\">OHM-breh</text>\n<text x=\"130\" y=\"750\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"28\">queso</text>\n<text x=\"470\" y=\"750\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"28\">--&gt;</text>\n<text x=\"620\" y=\"750\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"28\">KEH-soh</text>\n<text x=\"130\" y=\"815\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"28\">quince</text>\n<text x=\"470\" y=\"815\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"28\">--&gt;</text>\n<text x=\"620\" y=\"815\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"28\">KEEN-seh</text>\n<text x=\"130\" y=\"880\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"28\">ahora</text>\n<text x=\"470\" y=\"880\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"28\">--&gt;</text>\n<text x=\"620\" y=\"880\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"28\">ah-OH-rah</text>\n<text x=\"550\" y=\"1000\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">Silent means fully silent, not softly said.</text>\n</svg>",
      "caption": "The h and the u after q are written on the page and produce no sound at all."
     }
