     "explanation": "The answer begins with **a** (to), so the question asked about a destination, and destinations take **adónde**: **¿Adónde vas?** — where are you going (to)? **¿Dónde vas?** asks about position and is the form you will hear casually in parts of Spain, but standard Spanish keeps **dónde** for where something *is*: **¿Dónde está la playa?** **De dónde** asks about origin and would draw the answer **De Chile**, not **A la playa**. **Cuándo** would draw a time. A reliable habit: read the little word in front of the answer — **a**, **de** or **en** — and it points straight back at the question word.",
     "visual": {
      "type": "diagram",
      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"55\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">WHERE, TO WHERE, FROM WHERE</text><rect x=\"60\" y=\"120\" width=\"300\" height=\"440\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.15)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"210\" cy=\"250\" r=\"46\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"5\"/><circle cx=\"210\" cy=\"250\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#10b981\"/><text x=\"210\" y=\"360\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"30\">donde</text><text x=\"210\" y=\"430\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">position</text><text x=\"210\" y=\"470\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">no movement</text><text x=\"210\" y=\"520\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"20\">it sits still</text><rect x=\"400\" y=\"120\" width=\"300\" height=\"440\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"rgba(20,184,166,0.15)\" stroke=\"#14b8a6\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"500\" cy=\"250\" r=\"20\" fill=\"#14b8a6\"/><line x1=\"520\" y1=\"250\" x2=\"620\" y2=\"250\" stroke=\"#14b8a6\" stroke-width=\"5\"/><polygon points=\"620,235 655,250 620,265\" fill=\"#14b8a6\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"360\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14b8a6\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"30\">adonde</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"430\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">movement toward</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"470\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">a destination</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"520\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"20\">it heads out</text><rect x=\"740\" y=\"120\" width=\"300\" height=\"440\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"rgba(236,72,153,0.15)\" stroke=\"#ec4899\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"980\" cy=\"250\" r=\"20\" fill=\"#ec4899\"/><line x1=\"960\" y1=\"250\" x2=\"860\" y2=\"250\" stroke=\"#ec4899\" stroke-width=\"5\"/><polygon points=\"860,235 825,250 860,265\" fill=\"#ec4899\"/><text x=\"890\" y=\"360\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ec4899\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"30\">de donde</text><text x=\"890\" y=\"430\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">origin</text><text x=\"890\" y=\"470\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">where you start</text><text x=\"890\" y=\"520\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"20\">it comes from</text><rect x=\"60\" y=\"610\" width=\"980\" height=\"390\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.15)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"675\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"28\">HOW TO WORK IT OUT</text><text x=\"100\" y=\"740\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"24\">Read the answer before you read the options.</text><text x=\"100\" y=\"800\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"24\">The little word in front of it - a, de, en -</text><text x=\"100\" y=\"850\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"24\">points straight back at the question word.</text><text x=\"100\" y=\"920\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"22\">One of these three asks about a destination.</text><text x=\"100\" y=\"965\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"22\">The answer here is a destination.</text></svg>",
      "caption": "Position, destination and origin: three different questions hiding behind one English word."
     }
