    {
     "type": "application",
     "title": "Describe Six Things Around You",
     "content": "Everything in this lesson becomes automatic through use and in no other way. So do this now, out loud or on paper, before you move on.\n\n**Pick three people you actually know and three objects you can actually see.** Describe each with two adjectives, correctly agreed and correctly placed.\n\n**The frame:**\n**[Article] + [noun] + [adjective] + y + [adjective]**\nor with a verb: **[Person] es [adjective] y [adjective].**\n\n**Three people — worked examples to copy the shape of:**\n• **Mi hermana es alta y muy simpática.** — both adjectives feminine singular, because **hermana** is\n• **Mi jefe es un hombre trabajador y bastante serio.** — masculine, so **trabajador** with no -a\n• **Mis padres son mayores pero muy fuertes.** — plural, so both adjectives take -es\n\n**Three objects — same idea:**\n• **Mi coche es viejo y bastante sucio.** — masculine singular\n• **Tengo una mesa grande y muy limpia.** — **grande** ignores gender, **limpia** does not\n• **Son unas sillas nuevas y carísimas.** — feminine plural, and the **-ísimo** ending agrees too\n\n**Now yours. Run each one through three checks:**\n1. **Gender.** Is the noun masculine or feminine? Does every adjective match?\n2. **Number.** One or many? Vowel takes **-s**, consonant takes **-es**.\n3. **Position.** Is the adjective after the noun? If you put one before, did you mean the figurative sense?\n\n**Push yourself with three more sentences** once the six are done:\n• One comparison: **Mi casa es más pequeña que la casa de mi hermano.**\n• One superlative: **Es la calle más bonita de mi barrio.**\n• One **-ísimo**: **Mi trabajo es dificilísimo esta semana.**\n\nIf a sentence comes out and you are not certain the endings match, that uncertainty is the useful part — it tells you exactly which noun's gender you need to check. Look it up, fix it, and say the sentence again correctly. That loop, repeated a few dozen times, is what makes agreement stop being a decision and start being a reflex.\n\nNext lesson turns all of this on people: family, relationships, and introducing yourself properly.",
     "visual": {
      "type": "diagram",
      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"55\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">YOUR SIX SENTENCES</text><rect x=\"60\" y=\"95\" width=\"980\" height=\"110\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.15)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"140\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"bold\">THE FRAME</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"182\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"24\">article  +  noun  +  adjective  +  y  +  adjective</text><rect x=\"60\" y=\"230\" width=\"480\" height=\"300\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.15)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"300\" y=\"278\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"bold\">THREE PEOPLE</text><text x=\"90\" y=\"335\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"21\">Mi hermana es alta y</text><text x=\"90\" y=\"368\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"21\">muy simpatica.</text><text x=\"90\" y=\"418\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"21\">Mi jefe es un hombre</text><text x=\"90\" y=\"451\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"21\">trabajador y serio.</text><text x=\"90\" y=\"501\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"21\">Mis padres son mayores.</text><rect x=\"560\" y=\"230\" width=\"480\" height=\"300\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"rgba(20,184,166,0.15)\" stroke=\"#14b8a6\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"800\" y=\"278\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14b8a6\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"bold\">THREE OBJECTS</text><text x=\"590\" y=\"335\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"21\">Mi coche es viejo y</text><text x=\"590\" y=\"368\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"21\">bastante sucio.</text><text x=\"590\" y=\"418\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"21\">Tengo una mesa grande</text><text x=\"590\" y=\"451\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"21\">y muy limpia.</text><text x=\"590\" y=\"501\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"21\">Son unas sillas nuevas.</text><rect x=\"60\" y=\"570\" width=\"980\" height=\"290\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.15)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"618\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"bold\">RUN EACH ONE THROUGH THREE CHECKS</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"645\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" rx=\"30\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.15)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"130\" y=\"686\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-size=\"28\" font-weight=\"bold\">1</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"672\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"23\">GENDER</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"705\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"21\">masculine or feminine? do they all match?</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"720\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" rx=\"30\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.15)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"130\" y=\"761\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-size=\"28\" font-weight=\"bold\">2</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"747\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"23\">NUMBER</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"780\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"21\">vowel adds -s, consonant adds -es</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"795\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" rx=\"30\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.15)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"130\" y=\"836\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-size=\"28\" font-weight=\"bold\">3</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"822\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"23\">POSITION</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"855\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"21\">after the noun, unless you meant the other sense</text><rect x=\"60\" y=\"895\" width=\"980\" height=\"150\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.15)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"940\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"bold\">THEN PUSH FURTHER</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"982\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">one comparison, one superlative, one -isimo</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"1020\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"21\">Mi trabajo es dificilisimo esta semana.</text></svg>",
      "caption": "Six sentences, three checks each: gender, number, position. Repetition is what turns the rules into reflex."
     }
    }
