      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"55\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">THE RESTAURANT SCRIPT</text><circle cx=\"115\" cy=\"185\" r=\"38\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.15)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"115\" y=\"198\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"32\">1</text><rect x=\"185\" y=\"100\" width=\"855\" height=\"170\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.15)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"225\" y=\"150\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">GETTING IN</text><text x=\"225\" y=\"200\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Una mesa para dos, por favor.</text><text x=\"225\" y=\"240\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"22\">Tienen una mesa? - do you have a table?</text><circle cx=\"115\" cy=\"370\" r=\"38\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.15)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"115\" y=\"383\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"32\">2</text><rect x=\"185\" y=\"285\" width=\"855\" height=\"170\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.15)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"225\" y=\"335\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">THE MENU</text><text x=\"225\" y=\"385\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">la carta - the full list of dishes</text><text x=\"225\" y=\"425\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"22\">el menu del dia - the fixed-price set meal</text><circle cx=\"115\" cy=\"555\" r=\"38\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.15)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"115\" y=\"568\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"32\">3</text><rect x=\"185\" y=\"470\" width=\"855\" height=\"170\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.15)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"225\" y=\"520\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">ORDERING</text><text x=\"225\" y=\"570\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Que me recomienda? - what do you recommend?</text><text x=\"225\" y=\"610\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"22\">de primero - de segundo - de postre</text><circle cx=\"115\" cy=\"740\" r=\"38\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.15)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"115\" y=\"753\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"32\">4</text><rect x=\"185\" y=\"655\" width=\"855\" height=\"170\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.15)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"225\" y=\"705\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">SAYING WHAT YOU WANT</text><text x=\"225\" y=\"755\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Quisiera el pescado. - I would like the fish.</text><text x=\"225\" y=\"795\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"22\">Para mi, el pescado. - no verb needed at all</text><circle cx=\"115\" cy=\"922\" r=\"38\" fill=\"rgba(236,72,153,0.15)\" stroke=\"#ec4899\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"115\" y=\"935\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ec4899\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"32\">5</text><rect x=\"185\" y=\"840\" width=\"855\" height=\"165\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"rgba(236,72,153,0.15)\" stroke=\"#ec4899\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"225\" y=\"890\" fill=\"#ec4899\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">PAYING</text><text x=\"225\" y=\"938\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">La cuenta, por favor.</text><text x=\"225\" y=\"978\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"22\">Esta incluida la propina? - is the tip included?</text></svg>",
      "caption": "Five stages of a meal and the line you need at each one, from the door through to the bill."
